{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "f9b0fac5c87ab50a6ff16d2814a20c835901661f32bf4792d3feeacfce4bf7f7", "ja": "せっかくだから、メイッパイ！", "zh": "既然难得，就要全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5bb1f76ff6f6129398abd5a19a8795517ab03abdfb1bf785cd77b50446cadd53", "ja": "公演に向けてレッスンがスタート。記憶は戻\nらないままだが、ちゃんとこなすまつり。美\n也は公演のテーマも記憶喪失にしたらどうか\nと言い、そのため絶対にまつりの記憶を取り\n戻してみせると約束する。", "zh": "为公演开始了训练。虽然记忆仍未恢复，祭还是好好完成了训练。美\n也提议把公演主题也定为失忆，并约定一定会让祭恢复记忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9ce93ffc10e226add532a01a242c87cc43b5645b4cac2acdb7acbf9038c67d0a", "ja": "（今日から、タウラスのみんなのレッスンが始まった。\n一晩経って落ち着いたのか、まつりの表情は明るい）", "zh": "（从今天开始，金牛座大家的排练开始了。\n或许是过了一晚已经冷静下来，茉莉的表情很明朗。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1876e5707567400a64f09f3d10bc1f59f480882472bed58b727966ac14251652", "ja": "（記憶があやふやとはいえ、公演は待ってくれない。\n本人の希望もあり、レッスンは通常どおりの参加だ）", "zh": "（虽说记忆还有些模糊，但公演可不会等人。既然她本人希望如此，那就照常参加练习吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "60beda85cc22aeec0aee8d2ef6c539b66426e0d2db83072e8ea6c4c0437784b3", "ja": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8……イェ～イ♪", "zh": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8……耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b62c76b32f36081e85257ed72ec5da27022697b615088cdaa0f326265226ae9", "ja": "イェーイ♪", "zh": "耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "4180897c2adc1f287c3cff08f1da6bbf094cf0aa0b5d28276d7f59d249709c25", "ja": "すごいすごいー！\nまつりちゃん、もう振り付け覚えちゃった！", "zh": "好厉害好厉害——！\n小茉莉，我已经把舞蹈动作全都记住啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "86ee3efa837a61bfbb3ed6d5995ee24eb46c02a9e54420624962865938c28c26", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう！\nふたりが、丁寧に教えてくれたからだよ。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你！\n因为你们两位耐心地教我嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e8e8d8d5fceb68e9d671d20d610191d98d5105dd5258c9b04641314f62c3a96e", "ja": "それじゃ、少し休憩にしようか。\n公演をどうするかも考えないとだし……。", "zh": "那么，先稍微休息一下吧。\n也得考虑一下公演该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1008_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "7b3d10312d46041122ae5eb101f3afbecda5b09cb5ac9766d9ad4682b599b26a", "ja": "聞いたよー！　みんな、次の天体公演出るんでしょ！？\nねえ、どんなことするのー？", "zh": "我听说了哦——！大家要参加下一场天体公演，对吧！？\n告诉我嘛，你们要做些什么——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "10481f931751558d88c299931f948ce8497992f1df665752f755fc5d5c38ab9a", "ja": "たまきも知りたいぞー！　教えて教えてー！", "zh": "环也想知道——！告诉我，告诉我——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "13b7bce5888072b2c85f6b6ec186c6f8ef25ba21e3b0220f7e0039493c22c3cf", "ja": "あっ！　まつりん！\n記憶そーしつになったって聞いたけど、大丈夫！？", "zh": "啊！茉莉凛！\n听说你失忆了，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "98d525cb9c5256a808053b54d877c95fde9495cdb25966dcd46bcfd8d41efe64", "ja": "まつり、たまきは？　たまきのことわかる？", "zh": "茉莉，那环呢？你还认得环吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "cb34457603dab89541ac4cbadb6f10ae6cff7685a332655840d11ffd61946401", "ja": "え、えっと……。", "zh": "那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6686204af1849d4fc1627828d6430ed45760f80cc8101c134f432434bf6834e8", "ja": "ふたりとも、いっぺんに話しかけるんじゃないぞ。\nまつりが困ってるだろ。", "zh": "你们两个，别同时跟人搭话啊。\n都把小茉莉弄得为难了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "58ad6549f91cac41f582cc84e4f71f4498f5b3d6edcb1811ade3827e8cb32558", "ja": "あ、ごめん！　そっか、初めましてなんだっけ。\n私は、高坂海美！　海美って呼んでね☆", "zh": "啊，抱歉！对了，我们还是第一次见面来着。\n我是高坂海美！叫我海美哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "f2b96fa9f6b3df5698f68bcfbb47b4bc7c4819983fbfe2d2fc52c569d3b39a55", "ja": "たまきは、おおがみたまきだぞ！\nうみみもたまきも、まつりとおんなじアイドルなんだ！", "zh": "我是大神环！\n小海美和环，都是和茉莉一样的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "a00694b35751c169815d3a54bafad9dd6b46fa41d73c3cfbdd1caf6a4ff8811a", "ja": "海美ちゃんに、環ちゃん……うん、覚えたよ！\nそうだ、ふたりも一緒にレッスンする？", "zh": "海美和小环……嗯，我记住啦！\n对了，你们两个也要一起上课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "3c8f48d8a09fe331936807196149b3e37caedad640c8f2b4bd4a74d2a0e14408", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？\n私も環も、体動かすの大好きなんだっ！　ね、環！", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？\n我和环都最喜欢活动身体了！对吧，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "b49102d86de6403c4ec2cfc30b2b5d131517c3233b041595b71d34947bd54859", "ja": "うん！　わーい、みんなでレッスンだー！", "zh": "嗯！耶——大家一起练习——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "18566fb37806d71ef4c60171dc703a39ce7de2aa7e6152b5dba8b05d4147a2d2", "ja": "あっ！　私、勝手に決めちゃったけど……美也ちゃん、\n未来ちゃん、{$P$}さん。いいかな？", "zh": "啊！我擅自决定了……美也、小未来、{$P$}先生。可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "aa18aa3d502b51ad7d002eba7e83c5ddac1696422df4d44c1a7163dfbae4de95", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。未来と美也はどうだ？", "zh": "啊，没关系。未来和美也呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "b95dea7021ce28d558dab452aedbc6fedc4fa58dabcec8820040bd9ebc2fdfa8", "ja": "いいに決まってるよー！\nだって、レッスンはみんなでやったほうが楽しいもん♪", "zh": "那还用说，当然好啦——！\n毕竟练习还是大家一起做更开心嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "98770c062bee26616aafe0e5315b0f769d7bf101d5c4f83a67fceb745943ae6e", "ja": "はい～。それに、海美ちゃんや環ちゃんがいたら、\nまつりちゃんも、何か思い出せるかもしれませんし～。", "zh": "嗯～而且，有海美和环在的话，说不定茉莉也能想起些什么呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "78a0e3cc071b0faa3a018ca28d78bdc322126f1cfdd8b00d4e5747224ac0c745", "ja": "（飛び入り参加の海美と環が加わり、\nレッスンはいつにもましてにぎやかなものになった）", "zh": "（临时加入的海美和环也来了，练习比平时更加热闹了起来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "213c92319d49a9d397855620e550c30edad4ebb289c7d7a7023a3b688cf1c2f8", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。今日のレッスンはここまでに\nしよう。それから、公演のテーマなんだけど……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。今天的练习就到这里吧。然后，关于公演的主题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c720aac9d6adbc2b68303cff29fa08fd393e36aff3a045c093a4eb950de6cef", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ひらめきましたよ～。\n今回の公演のテーマは、記憶喪失にしましょう～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我想到啦～。\n这次公演的主题就定为失忆吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9ae182f3e2da3855c94fd818d0e99a32cc76050a261ae052815c990b4bf27f27", "ja": "え？　記憶喪失って……公演のテーマをか？", "zh": "诶？记忆丧失……是说这次公演的主题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "839f2b8cea16bc8862376b6ccee92d8288e077f3471f500a01fcd6ec2ea3356c", "ja": "はい～。\n記憶喪失って、なんだか不思議ですよね～？", "zh": "是呀～\n失忆这种事，总觉得很不可思议呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "23b51c15dec84055658d2c43aa05d46219fdf2d9292a34d4cb5521e70cd2c881", "ja": "たしかに、不思議かも！\nだって、見た目はいつものまつりちゃんだもんね。", "zh": "确实，可能挺不可思议的！\n因为从外表看，明明就是平时的茉莉嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "3834bd0ed0ca95e03f56f68c314e66025a084ee08ebc61cdb93d9c5ee649add7", "ja": "まつりちゃんが記憶を失くしてしまったのは、\n悲しいことかもしれません～。けど……。", "zh": "小祭失去记忆，也许是件令人难过的事～。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "d0c287971297577904b3400fe00f8230418b3e9a902dae49047a17f1e7d90c0a", "ja": "せっかくですから、悲しいだけじゃなくて、\n楽しんでほしいって思ったんです～。", "zh": "既然难得有这样的机会，我就想着，希望她不要只感到悲伤，也能享受一下～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "6d853eec13d5a7edef3f27ef9c513967f7780b612271af912bd9467f8b877a66", "ja": "記憶喪失を、楽しむ……？", "zh": "享受失忆……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "6beeb99375fd98a80ef190772518e943f3b6e527c81883c268c427d28be8c4c7", "ja": "はい～。前のまつりちゃんも、今のまつりちゃんも、\n楽しければ、悲しくならないかと思いまして～。", "zh": "是呀～我想着，只要过去的茉莉和现在的茉莉都能开心，应该就不会难过了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "fff1d244d8c3d601c258f51f197e489f4849709ba62566f3f01d8d8e90387d43", "ja": "そうだな。ただそれは、記憶が戻ればの話であって……\n今の状態でテーマにするのは、難しいかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊。不过那得等记忆恢复之后再说……以现在的状态把它作为主题，可能有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fd7dda4d097af5b9f91a8a9f27d014a806424e91efb1c02246be369e1d1da71", "ja": "そうでした……まずは、まつりちゃんの記憶を\n取り戻さないとですね～。む～ん……。", "zh": "对哦……首先得帮小祭找回记忆才行呢～。唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "60c6491fd795b3e9f0534fbe6ec405d6826e5a56f12b4ee6115be27cb7ff933a", "ja": "よーし、私たちでまつりちゃんの記憶を取り戻そうー！\n……でも記憶って、どうしたら戻るんだろう？", "zh": "好——我们来帮小祭恢复记忆吧！\n……不过，记忆要怎么才能恢复呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "4155ecf9f605172725f79924b15b210a8fe910bc20e63072b59fd083fe678f10", "ja": "それなら、劇場のみんなに会ってみるのはどう？\n控え室なら、誰かいるかもしれないし！", "zh": "那样的话，去见见剧场里的大家怎么样？\n休息室里说不定会有人在呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "3f1c18d8a6aa2eacdd07d2ed2d9ba7625c3144c3f1c9fffc5aa9dd4c4335bdf7", "ja": "お～。海美ちゃん、いい案ですな～。\nそれでは、みんなで劇場をお散歩しましょう～！", "zh": "哦～海美，真是个好主意呢～那我们大家一起去剧场散散步吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "f58040b89915adb062e65164f6b6812aae307323a7a7218862348f932421909d", "ja": "わーい、おさんぽ、おさんぽ～♪\nみらい、早くしないと置いてっちゃうぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "哇——散步，散步～♪\n未来，你再不快点就要把你丢下啦～！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "7a4a1972c5f98d6da049d08c76fb5057fbcc7ea6b191d01b5ad7b01d09c10fc7", "ja": "あっ。待ってよ、環～！", "zh": "啊，等等我，环～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "768c7f9c2faa9bf461fcbb52ce16167036c1ca5d5be7d7aa7a990febd932343e", "ja": "ではまつりちゃん、{$P$}さん。\n私たちも行きましょう～。", "zh": "那么，茉莉，{$P$}先生。\n我们也走吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "97c3d45c4e735577f915184c4f0b08564abbf13101107bd36f582bce1f94e6ba", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ～。まつりちゃんの記憶、\n絶対に、取り戻してみせますからね～。", "zh": "不用担心，没关系的哦～。茉莉的记忆，\n我一定会帮她找回来的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "6286dcf62081666e3884f07df2669155a4f58793800f83818adb3a5aa4ca289b", "ja": "あ、うん……！", "zh": "啊，嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "45ef1c0744b0500c4860339c6e620d9055e1d4b8ecfdda0855566c632fadbe02", "ja": "（まずは、まつりの記憶を取り戻すのが先決だけど……\nひとまず、みんなに任せてみよう）", "zh": "（虽然当务之急是先帮茉莉找回记忆……不过，暂且还是交给大家试试吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
